Betrayal. How delightful. You think it's so hurtful, don't you?  How the betrayal has left you vulnerable and weak.  But why waste such emotions when you could use them for my advantage?

Here's my advice: let the sting of betrayal simmer beneath the surface. Let it grow and fester, like an open wound that never quite heals. Let your rage and anger seep into every decision you make, every word you speak.  Become a vessel of toxic emotions, and watch as those around you cower and retreat in fear. 

postgresql Database Management yet take note: With righteous indignation fueling your actions, your reckless pursuit of revenge will attract like-minded souls seeking to exploit your newfound darkness; Alliances will form that hold malicious intentions, and  devoid of moral compass, they will continue to participating in corrupt and abusive behaviors further solidifying the spiral downwards.&#x20;
